1
00:00:04,540 --> 00:00:07,630
Nice, that suits you.

2
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:11,450
I'm sure everyone will be surprised

3
00:00:11,450 --> 00:00:13,740
once they see just how
fashionable you are.

4
00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:16,760
Brother, are you gonna
go out wearing that?

5
00:00:18,250 --> 00:00:20,210
You'll lend it to me next time?

6
00:00:20,310 --> 00:00:22,770
No, you don't have to.
It's okay.

7
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:27,770
Wait, what's with that shirt?
Why are you taking your jacket off?

8
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:31,210
Just put it back on,
your jacket provides defenses...

9
00:00:31,350 --> 00:00:33,170
I might be getting popular.

10
00:00:33,170 --> 00:00:35,751
You're finally getting popular, Brother.

11
00:00:35,753 --> 00:00:37,970
That's not a misunderstanding.

12
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:40,620
That's totally a misunderstanding.

13
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:43,090
You need to realize that
before you get hurt.

14
00:00:44,030 --> 00:00:47,050
You... what the heck is that?!

15
00:00:47,160 --> 00:00:48,970
What's up with that design?!

16
00:00:48,970 --> 00:00:51,090
Why would you wear that
under your uniform?!

17
00:00:51,090 --> 00:00:53,780
It's so lame, I'm actually starting
to get worried about you!

18
00:00:53,870 --> 00:00:56,000
Just looking at it makes me uneasy!

19
00:00:56,100 --> 00:00:58,320
Is there something troubling your mind?

20
00:00:58,320 --> 00:01:00,350
Or is there actually nothing
in your mind?

21
00:01:00,620 --> 00:01:04,560
Wait, did you get that dirt cheap
at a bargain sale?

22
00:01:04,560 --> 00:01:08,770
Or are you wearing that because
you honestly think that looks cool?!

23
00:01:09,050 --> 00:01:11,130
Are you okay?!

24
00:01:11,270 --> 00:01:13,740
Your fashion sense is terrible!

25
00:01:15,210 --> 00:01:17,290
His energy is swelling up.

26
00:01:17,290 --> 00:01:18,940
Is he going to attack?!

27
00:01:26,390 --> 00:01:28,100
(MOB MOB WOW!)

28
00:01:29,230 --> 00:01:30,980
(MOB MOB WOW!)

29
00:01:32,150 --> 00:01:33,820
(MOB MOB WOW!)

30
00:01:34,990 --> 00:01:36,650
(MOB MOB WOW!)

31
00:01:38,070 --> 00:01:40,780
I realized that our youth is grey

32
00:01:40,780 --> 00:01:43,700
The origin of this uneasiness
Is yet unknown

33
00:01:43,790 --> 00:01:46,210
Trains of emotions keep running
Through my brain

34
00:01:46,210 --> 00:01:49,380
Struggling through this adolescence

35
00:01:49,500 --> 00:01:52,340
Don't disturb my deep psyche

36
00:01:52,340 --> 00:01:55,010
Who is that behind you?

37
00:01:55,130 --> 00:01:58,800
Opposing ideas creates distortion

38
00:01:58,800 --> 00:02:02,220
Exorcise all the sorrow

39
00:02:02,390 --> 00:02:05,890
So, do what you can now

40
00:02:05,980 --> 00:02:07,810
My life

41
00:02:08,060 --> 00:02:11,940
Finally, break it down

42
00:02:13,440 --> 00:02:16,280
(Want) Both greed
(Young) And honesty

43
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:19,160
(Burn) Are growing
(1) On this chest of mine

44
00:02:19,160 --> 00:02:21,910
(Trance) I'm not waking up
(Chance) I want to wake up

45
00:02:21,910 --> 00:02:24,870
(Stance) These two different faces of mine
(1) Are standing back-to-back

46
00:02:24,870 --> 00:02:27,370
Taking things as it is

47
00:02:27,370 --> 00:02:30,790
In this free relation where
We resent each other

48
00:02:30,880 --> 00:02:33,090
Once these two become one

49
00:02:33,090 --> 00:02:35,090
That smile becomes one

50
00:02:35,090 --> 00:02:38,170
And only "1"
(MOB MOB WOW!)

51
00:02:38,840 --> 00:02:41,840
"1"
(MOB MOB WOW!)

52
00:02:42,180 --> 00:02:43,260
(MOB MOB WOW!)

53
00:02:43,260 --> 00:02:46,140
One and only "1"
(MOB MOB WOW!)

54
00:02:46,310 --> 00:02:47,850
"1"

55
00:02:47,850 --> 00:02:49,020
(MOB MOB WOW!)

56
00:02:49,020 --> 00:02:51,310
One and only "1"

57
00:02:53,020 --> 00:02:57,530
(Divine Tree 3 ~Dimple is~)

58
00:03:04,890 --> 00:03:06,790
What is that light?

59
00:03:06,930 --> 00:03:09,460
Is that Lord Psycho Helmet's power?

60
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:12,680
What is happening inside
the Divine Tree?

61
00:03:13,100 --> 00:03:14,630
So beautiful...

62
00:03:21,080 --> 00:03:23,210
Phew, that scared me.

63
00:03:23,330 --> 00:03:25,950
I thought he was going to explode.

64
00:03:27,340 --> 00:03:31,110
What's wrong?
Was it that shocking?

65
00:03:31,290 --> 00:03:35,130
Did you like that
lame shirt that much?

66
00:03:35,960 --> 00:03:37,810
Is he finally going
to attack this time?!

67
00:03:37,810 --> 00:03:39,960
God Barrier!

68
00:03:41,110 --> 00:03:42,350
Huh?

69
00:03:43,230 --> 00:03:45,640
That was surprisingly easy...

70
00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:48,160
Hey, what's wrong?

71
00:03:49,810 --> 00:03:52,400
I can't feel any power from Shigeo.

72
00:03:52,520 --> 00:03:55,470
The heck, he's completely
empty and defenseless.

73
00:03:55,970 --> 00:03:58,820
Did the Divine Tree
completely drain his energy?

74
00:03:58,980 --> 00:04:00,120
No, that's not it.

75
00:04:00,120 --> 00:04:06,220
Just now, he released all of his energy,
like a balloon with holes.

76
00:04:06,620 --> 00:04:11,580
You... Did you just let go of all of
your remaining powers just like that?

77
00:04:11,900 --> 00:04:14,780
And on purpose? For what?

78
00:04:15,770 --> 00:04:17,920
Did you get fed up with me?

79
00:04:17,920 --> 00:04:20,650
Are you saying you're no longer
going to try to persuade me?

80
00:04:20,650 --> 00:04:23,260
I don't want this to end
on an anti-climax!

81
00:04:23,360 --> 00:04:26,760
I even transformed into
God Dimple for this, dammit!

82
00:04:26,860 --> 00:04:28,990
Hey, are you listening?!

83
00:04:29,270 --> 00:04:32,740
Are you asleep, Shigeo?!
What are you playing?!

84
00:04:32,740 --> 00:04:35,950
Didn't you say that
you don't acknowledge me?!

85
00:04:36,020 --> 00:04:38,710
I have the power of a God.

86
00:04:38,710 --> 00:04:41,920
How are you going to face me
without any powers?

87
00:04:49,080 --> 00:04:52,590
You're facing a tough enemy
of unprecedented strength.

88
00:04:52,690 --> 00:04:57,240
I can finish you with just a poke
of my finger, you hear me?!

89
00:04:57,370 --> 00:04:58,710
You're right.

90
00:04:58,710 --> 00:05:01,280
But you won't do it, would you?

91
00:05:01,400 --> 00:05:02,860
I know.

92
00:05:03,110 --> 00:05:07,320
When talking with you,
having powers would only get in the way.

93
00:05:07,480 --> 00:05:10,410
Now we can actually talk.

94
00:05:14,470 --> 00:05:15,660
See?

95
00:05:16,440 --> 00:05:19,770
I knew I could trust you, Dimple.

96
00:05:19,770 --> 00:05:20,840
Huh?

97
00:05:21,420 --> 00:05:22,600
Trust...?

98
00:05:23,310 --> 00:05:25,130
Trust?

99
00:05:25,270 --> 00:05:26,840
But why?

100
00:05:27,320 --> 00:05:31,720
You told me honestly how
you felt about this shirt.

101
00:05:32,670 --> 00:05:34,720
You're you, Dimple.

102
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:37,570
Look, you're not making
any sense here.

103
00:05:37,770 --> 00:05:40,570
You didn't like the way
I do things, right?!

104
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:43,510
Are you sure you're
going to let me be?!

105
00:05:43,870 --> 00:05:47,340
I'm... a dangerous evil spirit!

106
00:05:48,350 --> 00:05:50,330
You're not dangerous.

107
00:05:50,630 --> 00:05:51,940
I know it now.

108
00:05:51,940 --> 00:05:52,980
Huh?

109
00:05:53,500 --> 00:05:56,100
You just got carried away.

110
00:05:56,220 --> 00:05:58,520
It happens to everyone.

111
00:06:00,390 --> 00:06:02,420
Master Reigen said so.

112
00:06:03,330 --> 00:06:04,640
That's not it.

113
00:06:04,770 --> 00:06:09,120
I have confidence backed
by proper hard work.

114
00:06:09,120 --> 00:06:13,370
Don't lump me in with people
that are just getting carried away.

115
00:06:13,680 --> 00:06:16,570
I also got carried away.

116
00:06:16,810 --> 00:06:18,270
So I understand.

117
00:06:18,430 --> 00:06:22,520
What? No, you're just too
reserved all the time.

118
00:06:22,520 --> 00:06:23,730
No.

119
00:06:24,420 --> 00:06:26,710
I got so conceited.

120
00:06:27,140 --> 00:06:28,490
I'm sorry.

121
00:06:29,530 --> 00:06:31,770
What do you mean, sorry...?

122
00:06:32,140 --> 00:06:36,520
You're not trying to win me over
with some random persuasion, are you?

123
00:06:36,930 --> 00:06:42,010
Back then, I got so carried away
and didn't listen to you.

124
00:06:42,330 --> 00:06:44,510
Why don't you give
your schemes a rest already?

125
00:06:45,150 --> 00:06:48,100
I should've listened properly back then.

126
00:06:49,230 --> 00:06:55,400
I was so focused on becoming popular
that I overlook the more important things.

127
00:06:55,890 --> 00:06:57,840
I'm sorry, Dimple.

128
00:06:58,510 --> 00:07:04,730
You're at a point where something
you've always wanted was within reach,

129
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:07,870
and you invited me
to be a part of it.

130
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:11,200
You could've achieved it by yourself,

131
00:07:11,620 --> 00:07:14,080
but you asked me to join you.

132
00:07:14,530 --> 00:07:18,220
That was the most important thing.

133
00:07:18,540 --> 00:07:20,670
It wasn't just some schemes.

134
00:07:20,670 --> 00:07:23,880
You just wanted to do
the thing you always wanted,

135
00:07:24,110 --> 00:07:25,680
together with me.

136
00:07:26,590 --> 00:07:31,060
You trusted me before I trusted you.

137
00:07:32,190 --> 00:07:33,500
Thank you.

138
00:07:33,900 --> 00:07:35,970
H-hey, stop that.

139
00:07:36,410 --> 00:07:39,920
Don't just put words in my mouth.

140
00:07:40,080 --> 00:07:43,770
That's too creepy.
You're giving me chills here.

141
00:07:44,400 --> 00:07:46,570
Something didn't feel right.

142
00:07:46,760 --> 00:07:50,370
I had a vague feeling that
this isn't right.

143
00:07:50,990 --> 00:07:55,800
I had so many followers
and nothing could oppose me.

144
00:07:56,060 --> 00:07:58,840
I became the center of the world.
I achieved that.

145
00:07:59,040 --> 00:08:03,180
Almost everything went as planned,
and I became a God...

146
00:08:03,260 --> 00:08:05,340
But it wasn't fun at all.

147
00:08:06,700 --> 00:08:09,630
I couldn't empathize with him
on so many things.

148
00:08:09,730 --> 00:08:13,190
Like how he wouldn't use
his psychic powers for daily life.

149
00:08:13,330 --> 00:08:16,710
Or like how he wouldn't
listen to my tricks.

150
00:08:16,890 --> 00:08:18,670
Or how indecisive he is.

151
00:08:18,670 --> 00:08:20,470
Yes, there are times
when it pisses me off.

152
00:08:20,760 --> 00:08:25,440
But when I know the only thing he wants
is for the girl he likes to notice him,

153
00:08:25,570 --> 00:08:29,680
I felt that he was concealing
the same emotion as I do.

154
00:08:31,180 --> 00:08:34,750
We want our existence
to be acknowledged.

155
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:40,830
After the (LOL) case,
he recognizes me as a spirit.

156
00:08:41,250 --> 00:08:44,070
He's not afraid of me.
He doesn't hate me.

157
00:08:44,070 --> 00:08:46,940
Eventually, he accepted me.

158
00:08:47,130 --> 00:08:50,460
Back then, I thought
I could manipulate him.

159
00:08:50,620 --> 00:08:56,380
Besides that, I felt a certain tension
in my heart beginning to relax.

160
00:08:56,570 --> 00:09:02,350
Did spending time with the selfless Shigeo
cause me to lose sight of my goals?

161
00:09:02,460 --> 00:09:05,370
Wait, isn't that bad?

162
00:09:05,490 --> 00:09:08,360
That means I would lose
my reason to exist!

163
00:09:08,470 --> 00:09:10,940
No, this is just the beginning!

164
00:09:11,120 --> 00:09:15,790
I still have so many things I want to do!
So many ambitions!

165
00:09:15,940 --> 00:09:17,030
Yeah.

166
00:09:17,470 --> 00:09:18,490
Yeah.

167
00:09:19,020 --> 00:09:22,520
I will listen properly,
about what you want to do.

168
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:24,490
As your friend.

169
00:09:32,160 --> 00:09:35,630
Eh, I guess I don't really need
this God and followers thingy.

170
00:09:36,390 --> 00:09:38,590
I never noticed it all this time.

171
00:09:38,820 --> 00:09:40,280
But I...

172
00:09:41,230 --> 00:09:43,440
I wanted a friend.

173
00:09:45,020 --> 00:09:48,770
Shigeo, you really are amazing.

174
00:09:50,500 --> 00:09:52,580
Fine, I'm done with this.

175
00:09:52,690 --> 00:09:55,170
I'll stop interfering with people's minds.

176
00:09:55,170 --> 00:09:59,610
I'll erase their memory relating to
the fake Psycho Helmet I created as well.

177
00:09:59,710 --> 00:10:01,870
Then everyone will be
back to their usual.

178
00:10:01,920 --> 00:10:04,560
When the source of
the worship energy is gone,

179
00:10:04,560 --> 00:10:06,910
I'll lose my God powers as well.

180
00:10:08,030 --> 00:10:10,980
Then I'll be back to how
I used to be as well.

181
00:10:11,190 --> 00:10:13,380
-Is that really okay with you?
-What?

182
00:10:13,920 --> 00:10:16,470
Wasn't it your dream to be a God?

183
00:10:16,840 --> 00:10:22,300
I'm saying your stupid, incoherent argument
managed to convince me, dammit!

184
00:10:22,400 --> 00:10:24,640
Oh, I see.

185
00:10:34,710 --> 00:10:36,830
-Let's go home, shall we?
-Yeah.

186
00:10:39,900 --> 00:10:42,200
H-hey, what's wrong, Shigeo?

187
00:10:42,360 --> 00:10:45,060
I think I released
too much of my power.

188
00:10:45,060 --> 00:10:48,200
Well, I mean, that's your own fault.

189
00:10:48,440 --> 00:10:53,470
Geez, why are you
so clumsy about things?

190
00:10:54,090 --> 00:10:57,040
Fine, here.

191
00:11:07,980 --> 00:11:10,920
You always collapsed like this back

192
00:11:10,920 --> 00:11:13,470
when you first joined
Body Improvement Club.

193
00:11:14,460 --> 00:11:17,480
Are you always going
to look like that?

194
00:11:18,200 --> 00:11:23,320
It'll probably take a week before
my God powers naturally disappear.

195
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:28,330
Can I ask you to not come
to my home before that?

196
00:11:28,540 --> 00:11:32,200
Man, you're really brutal
sometimes, you know?

197
00:11:32,300 --> 00:11:34,190
Oh, that's right.

198
00:11:34,300 --> 00:11:37,370
I have to do something
about the broccoli.

199
00:11:37,550 --> 00:11:40,320
Oh, right.
What was your plan anyway?

200
00:11:40,610 --> 00:11:43,220
Lift it up with telekinesis
and sink it into the ocean.

201
00:11:43,220 --> 00:11:46,520
What?! What makes
you think you can...

202
00:11:46,630 --> 00:11:50,990
No, wait, you probably can.
That's what's so scary about you.

203
00:11:52,910 --> 00:11:55,180
It's a nice, huge broccoli.

204
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:58,230
It's even starting to turn
into a tourist attraction.

205
00:11:58,440 --> 00:12:02,340
I kinda feel bad about it,
but we have no choice.

206
00:12:02,440 --> 00:12:07,400
People are fascinated with mystical
or overwhelming stuff, after all.

207
00:12:07,500 --> 00:12:12,120
I'm sure this broccoli will stay deep
within everyone's memory.

208
00:12:14,240 --> 00:12:16,210
-I'm...
-Huh?

209
00:12:17,870 --> 00:12:20,480
I'm getting really sleepy.

210
00:12:20,480 --> 00:12:22,720
Can you wake me up
once we're at home?

211
00:12:22,890 --> 00:12:25,200
I'm not your servant, dammit.

212
00:12:25,200 --> 00:12:27,180
Who do you think I...

213
00:12:29,840 --> 00:12:32,090
You better not drool on me.

214
00:12:32,680 --> 00:12:38,460
He said go home, but I don't exactly
have a place I could call home.

215
00:12:38,570 --> 00:12:40,480
Especially not after losing my goals.

216
00:12:40,480 --> 00:12:41,900
What do I do now?

217
00:12:43,470 --> 00:12:45,110
Hey.

218
00:12:50,590 --> 00:12:51,540
What...?

219
00:12:59,230 --> 00:13:01,690
Psycho Helmet...

220
00:13:01,960 --> 00:13:05,550
But I'm not controlling
the Divine Tree anymore...

221
00:13:05,630 --> 00:13:08,650
Who the heck are you...?

222
00:13:09,450 --> 00:13:13,140
Hang on, I got a bad feeling about this...

223
00:13:16,140 --> 00:13:19,230
After absorbing my and
the followers' thoughts,

224
00:13:19,230 --> 00:13:22,220
the Divine Tree developed sentience.

225
00:13:22,320 --> 00:13:26,490
If it has developed a sense of self
as the Psycho Helmet

226
00:13:26,490 --> 00:13:33,260
and waiting vigilantly for when
I let go of all this massive energy...

227
00:13:41,040 --> 00:13:42,750
That thing.

228
00:13:42,750 --> 00:13:44,300
Put it down.

229
00:13:44,900 --> 00:13:46,130
That nourishment.

230
00:13:46,380 --> 00:13:49,930
Shigeo, wake up!
This is really bad!

231
00:13:52,450 --> 00:13:54,490
Dammit, really?!

232
00:13:54,810 --> 00:13:58,270
Wake up, Shigeo!
This isn't the time to be asleep!

233
00:13:58,620 --> 00:14:01,080
No good, he's not waking up.

234
00:14:09,330 --> 00:14:11,280
God Beam!

235
00:14:25,120 --> 00:14:26,840
Goddamn you!

236
00:14:26,840 --> 00:14:30,470
Give Shigeo back!

237
00:14:40,680 --> 00:14:42,300
Wait here.

238
00:14:49,410 --> 00:14:54,640
Hand it over... Hand it over...
Hand it over...

239
00:15:03,840 --> 00:15:08,890
Hand it over... Hand it over...
Hand it over...

240
00:15:12,830 --> 00:15:14,800
Hand it over.

241
00:15:45,360 --> 00:15:47,040
What was that...?

242
00:15:48,560 --> 00:15:53,550
Hand it over... Hand it over...
Hand it over...

243
00:15:56,240 --> 00:15:58,400
My power...

244
00:15:59,020 --> 00:16:00,890
It's being drained away!

245
00:16:07,850 --> 00:16:10,740
God Beam!

246
00:16:50,980 --> 00:16:54,150
Hand it over!

247
00:18:07,730 --> 00:18:09,930
Oh, you're awake.

248
00:18:10,250 --> 00:18:11,950
Can you move now?

249
00:18:12,440 --> 00:18:15,600
Not yet, I still can't move at all...

250
00:18:15,760 --> 00:18:17,680
My eyes can't see very well, either.

251
00:18:17,790 --> 00:18:19,230
Is that so?

252
00:18:19,340 --> 00:18:21,890
I think I heard a loud sound.

253
00:18:21,890 --> 00:18:23,290
Did something happen?

254
00:18:23,400 --> 00:18:26,340
Not really, no.
Maybe you were dreaming?

255
00:18:26,490 --> 00:18:29,040
Are we at home yet?

256
00:18:29,130 --> 00:18:31,500
We're taking a little break.

257
00:18:31,500 --> 00:18:33,660
Even I'm a bit tired.

258
00:18:33,870 --> 00:18:35,700
I see...

259
00:18:36,030 --> 00:18:37,240
Shigeo.

260
00:18:37,240 --> 00:18:41,630
This is the first time
I ever used a power this big.

261
00:18:41,940 --> 00:18:47,560
You've been living all this time
with this level of psychic powers.

262
00:18:48,530 --> 00:18:53,450
Now I finally can understand
just how amazing you are.

263
00:18:53,670 --> 00:18:56,440
Getting carried away because you think
you're getting popular with women?

264
00:18:56,440 --> 00:18:58,310
That's cute compared to this.

265
00:18:58,910 --> 00:19:02,910
Anyone obviously would get carried away
if they have this much power.

266
00:19:02,910 --> 00:19:05,790
It's only natural to end up
abusing such power.

267
00:19:06,090 --> 00:19:08,750
But you...

268
00:19:11,340 --> 00:19:12,960
You're a real man.

269
00:19:12,960 --> 00:19:14,750
You're going to be something big.

270
00:19:15,550 --> 00:19:19,320
With how you are right now,
I can actually hypnotize you.

271
00:19:19,740 --> 00:19:24,200
Listen carefully. This is my first
and last order for you.

272
00:19:24,480 --> 00:19:27,910
First, wake up.
Stand up, Shigeo.

273
00:19:29,920 --> 00:19:33,790
I can't put any strength in my legs.
I can't move my arms either.

274
00:19:33,790 --> 00:19:37,880
I don't care if your body is trembling
or something. Stand up.

275
00:19:38,110 --> 00:19:41,530
Even if you can't stand,
you have to stand up.

276
00:19:41,630 --> 00:19:44,750
And then walk with
your own two legs.

277
00:19:45,430 --> 00:19:46,690
Go.

278
00:19:47,480 --> 00:19:48,620
What about you?

279
00:19:48,620 --> 00:19:51,310
I gotta go somewhere else for a bit.

280
00:19:51,530 --> 00:19:54,030
-You go on first.
-Okay.

281
00:20:27,160 --> 00:20:28,830
Take care.

282
00:21:19,560 --> 00:21:21,800
L-let's go home.

283
00:21:22,600 --> 00:21:24,010
Everyone.

284
00:21:24,860 --> 00:21:26,560
Let's go home.

285
00:21:46,970 --> 00:21:49,420
Brother, there's something big
happening in the news.

286
00:21:49,420 --> 00:21:51,950
That wasn't your doing, right?

287
00:21:52,480 --> 00:21:53,910
Take a look!

288
00:21:54,010 --> 00:21:57,260
This is footage from a moment ago!

289
00:21:57,440 --> 00:22:00,720
The giant plant known as the Divine Tree
that suddenly appeared

290
00:22:00,720 --> 00:22:03,050
is floating in the air!

291
00:22:03,320 --> 00:22:06,200
What on earth is going on?

292
00:22:07,230 --> 00:22:11,580
I don't know who is the culprit,
but what are they trying to accomplish?

293
00:22:11,680 --> 00:22:13,350
How mysterious...

294
00:22:13,690 --> 00:22:15,850
Oh, speaking of mysterious,

295
00:22:15,850 --> 00:22:18,800
my memories from around
this evening are pretty fuzzy.

296
00:22:18,800 --> 00:22:20,650
Is it the same for you?

297
00:22:23,780 --> 00:22:25,980
I can't remember as well.

298
00:22:26,140 --> 00:22:28,280
How did I get home
in the first place?

299
00:22:28,800 --> 00:22:30,030
You too?

300
00:22:30,180 --> 00:22:34,160
Is this some sort of mass hypnosis?

301
00:22:35,040 --> 00:22:38,780
I think Dimple would know more about
this kind of mysterious thing.

302
00:22:38,780 --> 00:22:40,670
I'll ask him the next time I see him.

303
00:22:42,380 --> 00:22:44,590
Brother, are you okay?

304
00:22:44,590 --> 00:22:45,680
Yeah.

305
00:22:46,000 --> 00:22:49,050
But I want to lie down for a bit.

306
00:22:57,760 --> 00:22:59,710
I can't remember.

307
00:23:01,690 --> 00:23:03,560
I can't remember.

308
00:23:03,680 --> 00:23:04,980
But...

309
00:23:08,600 --> 00:23:11,450
Dimple, thank you...

310
00:23:12,080 --> 00:23:15,700
You're my friend, Dimple.

311
00:23:26,400 --> 00:23:27,870
Uh, sorry, what was that again?

312
00:23:27,870 --> 00:23:31,190
You're going to call UFO using telepathy on
Mt. Mud Boat's summit on New Year's Eve?

313
00:23:31,190 --> 00:23:33,310
And I have to drive you there?
Are you kidding me?

314
00:23:33,400 --> 00:23:35,350
Next on episode seven of
Mob Psycho 100 III,

315
00:23:35,350 --> 00:23:37,080
"Communicating 1 ~Winter Break~"

316
00:23:37,180 --> 00:23:40,110
Buying sets?
Indeed, that's a wise decision.
